+            | tr -s '\n' ',' \
+        )"
+
+Link: https://github.com/pulehui/riscv-bpf-vmtest.git [0]
+Link: https://github.com/libbpf/ci/blob/main/rootfs/mkrootfs_debian.sh [1]
 
